sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Staff)
    participant UI_Cam as CameraScreen (Flutter)
    participant ML as TfService (TFLite)
    participant UI_Inv as InventoryScreen (Flutter)
    participant API as Backend API (Flask)
    participant DB as Database (SQL)

    Note over User, DB: Flow: Scan Barang -> Identifikasi -> Update Stok

    User->>UI_Cam: Buka Menu Scan & Capture Foto
    activate UI_Cam
    UI_Cam->>ML: classifyImage(imagePath)
    activate ML
    ML-->>UI_Cam: Return Result (Label: "Palu", Conf: 95%)
    deactivate ML

    alt Confidence < 50%
        UI_Cam-->>User: Tampilkan Alert "Objek Tidak Dikenal"
    else Confidence >= 50%
        UI_Cam->>UI_Inv: Navigasi ke Inventory (query="Palu")
        deactivate UI_Cam
        activate UI_Inv
        
        Note right of UI_Inv: Auto-search saat init
        UI_Inv->>API: GET /get_barang
        activate API
        API->>DB: Tool.get_all()
        activate DB
        DB-->>API: Return List[Tool]
        deactivate DB
        API-->>UI_Inv: JSON Response
        deactivate API

        UI_Inv->>UI_Inv: Filter List berdasarkan "Palu"
        UI_Inv-->>User: Tampilkan Card Barang "Palu"

        User->>UI_Inv: Klik "Ambil Barang" & Input Jumlah
        UI_Inv->>API: POST /update_barang
        activate API
        Note right of UI_Inv: Body: {nama_barang: "Palu", jumlah: 1, ...}
        
        API->>DB: Tool.update_stock(nama, jumlah)
        activate DB
        Note right of DB: 1. Kurangi Stok<br/>2. Catat History
        DB-->>API: Return Success
        deactivate DB
        
        API-->>UI_Inv: 200 OK
        deactivate API
        
        UI_Inv->>UI_Inv: Refresh Data (_loadTools)
        UI_Inv-->>User: Tampilkan Notifikasi Sukses
        deactivate UI_Inv
    end
